
Set Comprehension

Returns a unique, unordered collection. It uses a single value expression.
# Syntax
new_set = {expression for item in iterable if condition}


Dictionary Comprehension

Returns a collection of key-value pairs. It uses a key: value expression.

# Syntax
new_dict = {key_expression: value_expression for item in iterable if condition}

